  "simulation_requirement": "1) Brief introduction of the DBS History series: DBS History is a heritage series built around historical recounts of defining moments in DBS’ journey. It features carefully researched historical moments drawn from archives, employee recollections and institutional records to recount how the bank evolved alongside the communities and nations it serves.\r\n\r\n2) Key message of this post: DBS has always looked ahead to what customers, businesses and communities would need next. From supporting Singapore's industrialisation in its early years to harnessing AI today, the bank has continually evolved to create new opportunities, build capabilities and better serve its customers.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n3) Intention of this post: This post commemorates DBS' 58th anniversary by showing how the bank's future-focused mindset has remained consistent across generations. While the post begins with DBS' role in supporting a young nation's development, its primary focus is on how DBS has continually anticipated change and adapted to evolving customer needs. The foundations laid in its early years through investments in industries, talent, technology and innovation have enabled DBS to become the AI-enabled bank with a heart it is today. The post positions AI not as a new direction, but as the latest chapter in a long history of reimagining banking to better serve customers.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n4) Strategic Outcome: The post should help audiences see a clear connection between DBS' pioneering spirit in the past and its continued leadership in AI today. Reinforce DBS as a bank that is:\r\n\r\nCustomer-centric\r\nFuture-focused and innovative\r\nWilling to embrace change and new technologies\r\nAn AI-enabled bank with a heart",
